Implementation | Functional Role in the Living Identity |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **The Soul (DNA)** | **Web3 secp256k1 Keypair & SID** | The immutable genetic imprint. Generated at genesis; defines sovereign identity on Ethereum and the conglomerate ledger. |\n| **The Spine** | **3tchedFS (FUSE Engine)** | The central nervous system. Projects typed signals from SHM and sealed blobs into the filesystem, coordinating all motor functions. |\n| **The Heart** | **Sealed opblobs (SHM Engine)** | The living rhythm. Pumps sealed, tamper-proof schemas and capabilities into the running organism. Bridge startup only drinks from this pump. |\n| **The Ears** | **WhisperFlow & Muse Spark** | The auditory perception organs. Streams ambient speech, voice inputs, and audio frequencies into cognitive comprehension. |\n| **The Prefrontal Cortex** | **Cozo Datalog Engine** | Deductive logic and executive function. Evaluates relational rules, temporal graphs, and subsidiary boundaries. |\n| **The Associative Cortex** | **Qdrant Vector Cluster** | Intuition, semantic recall, and associative pattern-matching across historical experiences. |\n| **The Hippocampus** | **Sparse ext4 Partition (`p2`)** | Private episodic memory. Stores private transactional ledgers and confidential memories without write amplification. |\n| **The Body (Flesh)** | **Btrfs Leaf Partition (`p1`)** | Somatic tissue. Dynamically expandable via `btrfs device add`, allowing the container to absorb new state and heal from snapshots. |\n| **The Lungs** | **Tonic Door `:8090`** | The respiratory tract. Breathes native gRPC HTTP/2 streams in and out over the wire with microsecond latency. |\n| **The Bloodstream** | **WARP Tunnel & WireGuard** | The circulatory system. Transports encrypted signals between the internal organs and the external decoy face. |\n\n---\n\n### The Birth Sequence (Post-12pm Ritual)\n\nWhen we invoke the provisioning script, the console output will project this biological emergence:\n\n1. **`GE